      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The flumph can perceive any telepathic messages sent or received within 60 feet, and can't be surprised by creatures with telepathy. The flumph is also immune to divination and to any effect that would sense its emotions or read its thoughts, except for the Telepathic Spy feature of another flumph."
      ]
